<title>USA: FSF Financial takes $0.20 shr Q4 charge.</title>
<headline>FSF Financial takes $0.20 shr Q4 charge.</headline>
<dateline>HUTCHINSON, Minn. 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>FSF Financial Corp said Monday it has taken a one-time charge of $1.03 million, or $0.20 a share, in its fiscal fourth quarter.</p>
<p>The charge is a result of provisions in the Omnibus Appropriations Legislation passed by the U.S. Congress and signed by President Clinton on September 30, the company said.</p>
